OL,3,AManchester Co-op Live evacuated after
OL,4,Asuspected tear gas incident
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of people were evacuated from
OL,7,Fa concert in Manchester on Sunday night
OL,8,Fafter tear gas was believed to have
OL,9,Fbeen let off in the crowd.
OL,11,FThe incident happened towards the end
OL,12,Fof US rapper Don Toliver's show at the
OL,13,FCo-op Live arena at about 22:00.
OL,15,FGreater Manchester Police said no
OL,16,Fserious injuries were reported and
OL,17,Fthose affected were treated by
OL,18,Femergency services.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
