OL,3,AManchester Co-op Live evacuated after
OL,4,Asuspected tear gas incident
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe force said a major incident had
OL,7,Fbeen declared "to ensure emergency
OL,8,Fservices and partner agencies can work
OL,9,Ftogether quickly and effectively to
OL,10,Fcoordinate a safe response".
